    ; tested, and its body runs. A `while` or `until` clause, and a `break` that leaves no loop of
    ; the body, unsubscribe it from the stream it is given. Its own closure type is recorded at its
    ; `for` block, for the value it unsubscribes. A `break` or a `continue` in a loop of the body
    ; belongs to that loop.
